WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.752
Let them talk, I don't care.

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.922
Speaking of Hinode,
he's been acting smug lately.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:06.881
You think so?

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:08.758
All high and mighty.

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:09.968
What?

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:13.221
His grades shot up. It makes no sense!

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:15.724
He must have cheated on the tests.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.434
His grades were like mine back in--

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.186
Muge? What are you planning to do?

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:22.022
-Food food!
-Thanks for the food.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.732
No, don't!

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:28.945
Muge, calm down! Muge!
Someone stop her, please!

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:32.532
What was that about Hinode? Take it back!

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.284
-What? Are you crazy?
-What is she...

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:35.952
Muge?

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:38.747
What?

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.917
Muge!

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:50.258
What's with you?

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.762
This is so much easier when I'm a cat.

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:57.849
-Blood! I'm bleeding!
-Are you crazy?

00:00:58.349 --> 00:01:00.435
That's my line!

00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:01.519
What?

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:02.645
Hinode is always--

00:01:03.605 --> 00:01:05.482
He works really hard!

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.860
-Stop lying about him, or I'll--
-Muge!

00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:12.405
Are you okay?

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:15.575
"Are you okay?"

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.662
-Hey, let's go.
-Yeah.

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:22.540
I'm fine. I'm totally fine!

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.793
Were you worried about me?

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.920
You should go to the nurse's office.

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:30.131
-It's nothing, really--
-Let's go.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.342
Okay.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.640
You don't have to do that,
I'll clean that up myself.

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:40.600
You can have half of my lunch box.

00:01:40.683 --> 00:01:44.729
What? What? Wait, really?

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:52.862
This is... boiled sweet potatoes!

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:55.949
I didn't know you could cook.

00:01:56.241 --> 00:01:58.409
-You made all that yourself?
-Yup.

00:01:58.493 --> 00:01:59.911
That's incredible!

00:01:59.994 --> 00:02:01.746
My dad should learn
a thing or two from you.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:06.709
Look at that color, that shine!
I bet it's really salty.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:07.752
Don't complain.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:12.715
That was a compliment!
It tastes just like my mom's.

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:15.885
You should have ignored those two.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.220
I agree.

00:02:17.512 --> 00:02:20.014
They can say whatever they want about me.

00:02:20.431 --> 00:02:23.560
But I won't let them
slander you like that.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.939
These boiled potatoes are amazing!

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.736
-Hey!
-Muge, what are you doing?

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.867
Hinode's boiled potatoes are...

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.953
really salty!

00:02:44.205 --> 00:02:46.332
You should say it's delicious.

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.001
"Really salty"?

00:02:48.084 --> 00:02:50.211
I see. Okay! Then...

00:02:50.295 --> 00:02:52.338
-Hinode's boiled potatoes are--
-Knock it off!

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:54.465
You don't have to redo it!

00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:55.717
Why?

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.434
His rice may be salty too, Muge.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.894
Shut up!

00:03:06.769 --> 00:03:09.480
Did I just make Hinode laugh?

00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:12.483
Don't go jumping off
buildings again, okay?

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:14.194
You're not a cat.

00:03:17.488 --> 00:03:18.781
Ta-da!

00:03:19.824 --> 00:03:21.326
She has the same scent.

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:24.913
Eat up, Hinode. Don't be shy. Open wide.

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:26.206
It's my lunch box, okay?

